  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach Prince talent grants
    this ally 8% reach, up to 24%. Final melee/ranged reach caps still apply.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Heart healing: +1\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA lamplighter who circled a homeward beacon until discovering
    its keeper turned it to prevent arrivals. They now guide by several independent
    lights. They want routes no single keeper can own.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery
    4s, chill enemies within 2.313 units: 1.5s normally, 0.6s on bosses.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: astral, regal, morning. Immortal. Weapon rolls
    on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent
    forbids it."
